# ⏰ Digital Clock (HTML, CSS, JS)

A responsive, animated digital clock with a glassmorphism design, live greeting, date display, 12h/24h toggle, and 4 switchable color themes.

## Features

- Real-time hours, minutes, seconds
- 12-hour / 24-hour format toggle
- Auto greeting (Good Morning / Afternoon / Evening / Night)
- Full date display
- 4 built-in color themes (Aurora, Ocean, Sunset, Midnight)
- Fully responsive, no external JS libraries

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)

